<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP FIRST ROUND RESULTS. [CORRECTED 22:25 GMT]</title>
<headline>TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP FIRST ROUND RESULTS. [CORRECTED 22:25 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of first round matches in the men's Kremlin Cup tennis tournament:</p>
<p>Andrei Olhovsky (Russia) beat Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) 6-2 5-7 6-2</p>
<p>Jakob Hlasek (Switzerland) beat Tomas Carbonell (Spain) 7-6 (8-6) 6-2</p>
<p>Guy Forget (France) beat Adrian Voina (Romania) 6-2 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>8-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Renzo Furlan (Italy) 4-6 7-6 (7-6) 6-4.  </p>
<p>6-MaliVai Washington (U.S.) beat Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) 7-6 (7-4) 6-2</p>
<p>Martin Damm (Czech Republic) beat 4-Cedric Pioline (France) 6-4 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>(Corrects from Pioline beating Damm)</p>
</text>
